---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = "农业用丝网：围栏、防护网与畜牧应用";
const description = "农牧业丝网应用指南。涵盖畜牧围栏、作物防护、温室应用和户外耐久材料选择。";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">农业用丝网</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-muted max-w-2xl">
        从圈养牲畜到作物防护，农业丝网必须
        经受住天气、牲畜和机械应力的考验。本指南涵盖农牧应用的
        选择与采购。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/zh/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">首页</a> / 
    <span>应用领域</span> / 
    农业
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">农业应用</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        丝网在现代农业中用途多样，各有不同的
        性能要求：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>畜牧围栏</strong> — 牛、马、羊和家禽圈养</li>
        <li><strong>作物防护</strong> — 防鸟网、防鹿网、防雹网</li>
        <li><strong>温室建设</strong> — 苗床面、爬藤架、遮阳支撑</li>
        <li><strong>仓储</strong> — 粮囤、青贮防护、干草堆垛</li>
        <li><strong>水产养殖</strong> — 网箱、池塘分隔、防天敌</li>
        <li><strong>农场设施</strong> — 机械防护罩、通风网、分群栏</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Livestock Fencing -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">按牲畜选择围栏</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        不同牲畜需要不同的围栏设计：
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">牲畜</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">推荐围栏</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">高度</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">关键特性</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">牛</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">草原网、刺绳</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1.2-1.5m</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">高张力、打结结构</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">马</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">草原网、编织网</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1.4-1.6m</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">可视、无尖锐边缘、底部网孔小</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">羊/山羊</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">编织网、网围栏</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1.0-1.2m</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">底部孔小（15-20cm），防天敌</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">家禽</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">六角网、焊接网</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1.8-2.0m</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">小孔（25-50mm），防天敌挖掘</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">猪</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">焊接网片、重型编织网</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">0.9-1.1m</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">坚固、低贴地面、抗挖掘</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Crop Protection -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">作物防护网</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        保护作物免受鸟类、动物和天气侵害：
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">防鸟网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            轻型网（网孔 20-40mm），覆盖果树、浆果灌木
            或葡萄园。常用抗紫外线聚乙烯或聚丙烯。
            丝网版本寿命更长，适合固定安装。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">防鹿网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            高（2.0-2.4m）编织网或焊接网，小网孔。必须承受
            鹿的冲击并防止幼鹿进入。推荐高张力丝。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">防雹网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            网孔 6-10mm 的顶棚网。在允许
            授粉和光照的同时减少冰雹损害。需要坚固的支架结构。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">防虫网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            网孔 0.6-1.2mm 的细网，用于温室通风口。防止害虫
            进入同时保持通风。抗紫外线材料必不可少。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Material Selection -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">农业材料选择</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        农业网材面临独特挑战：紫外线照射、牲畜接触、
        化肥化学品以及设备造成的机械应力。
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>镀锌钢</strong> — 永久围栏的标准选择。锌层 200-300g/m²，寿命 15-20 年。</li>
        <li><strong>PVC 包塑</strong> — 额外保护和颜色选择（绿、黑）。可见边界常用。</li>
        <li><strong>高张力钢</strong> — 更高强度允许用更轻的丝达到同等性能。可加大立柱间距。</li>
        <li><strong>不锈钢</strong> — 腐蚀环境（沿海、集约化养殖）的高端选择。</li>
        <li><strong>聚乙烯/聚丙烯</strong> — 轻质抗紫外线选择，适合临时或季节性使用。</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded p-4 mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-accent">
          <strong>成本洞察：</strong>高张力丝比普通丝贵 20-30%，
          但可将立柱间距加大 30-40%，降低围栏总成本。长距离
          周界围栏采用高张力丝通常总安装成本更低。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Installation -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">安装注意事项</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">立柱间距</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            标准：高张力草原网 8-12m，焊接网片 3-4m。
            转角柱和大门柱需要额外支撑。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">地形适应</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            坡地上，可阶梯式安装网片或使用可贴合
            地形的柔性编织网。编织草原网比刚性网片更适应起伏地形。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">防天敌</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            家禽和小牲畜养殖，请将网埋入地下 30cm 或加装地面翻边，
            防止狐狸、郊狼、狗等挖洞。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">大门与通行</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            规划大门位置以兼顾设备通行和牲畜流动。大门宽度
            决定机械通行；拖拉机至少 3.6m，联合收割机 6m 以上。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sourcing -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">农业网材采购</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        关键规格要点：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>网材类型（编织草原网、焊接网片、六角网）</li>
        <li>丝径和抗拉强度</li>
        <li>锌层重量（g/m²）或涂层类型</li>
        <li>卷或网片的尺寸</li>
        <li>边缘处理（平边、打结边、加强边）</li>
        <li>抗紫外线稳定（聚合物网材）</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        大型周界项目可使用我们的<a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">重量计算器</a>估算
        材料和运输总成本。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">继续探索</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/applications/fence/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">丝网围栏系统</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">通用围栏类型与规格</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/wire-mesh-fence-panels/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">护栏网片</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">农场用刚性网片规格</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/gabion-baskets/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">石笼网箱</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">水土保持与土地治理</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/anping-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">安平丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">农业网材制造中心</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">需要农业网材？</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-muted mb-4">发送您的项目需求，我们将为您对接合格的制造商。</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block accent-bg hover:accent-bg text-theme-primary font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        提交询盘
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
